This program plays TIC-TAC-TOE.  Your mark is X and you will play first.
The board is numbered as follows:

012
345
678

When it is your turn to play, type the number of the square you wish to mark.
For example, if you type '4', the result is:

...
.X.
...

Any time it is your turn to play, you may start a new game by typing 'N'
or end the session by typing 'Q'
